"Missing next-hop is regarded as 0.0.0.0.\n"
"Missing metric means default (NM/kernel will set a default value).\n"
"\n"
"Examples: 192.168.2.0/24 192.168.2.1 3, 10.1.0.0/16 10.0.0.254\n"
"          10.1.2.0/24\n"
